          "type": "Line",
          "position": "before",
          "sameLine": false,
          "value": " Each element expression in a non-empty array literal is processed as follows:"
        },
        {
          "type": "Line",
          "position": "before",
          "sameLine": false,
          "value": "    - If the array literal contains no spread elements, and if the array literal is contextually typed (section 4.19)"
