          "type": "Line",
          "position": "before",
          "sameLine": false,
          "value": "      by a type T and T has a property with the numeric name N, where N is the index of the element expression in the array literal,"
        },
        {
          "type": "Line",
          "position": "before",
          "sameLine": false,
          "value": "      the element expression is contextually typed by the type of that property."
        },
        {
          "type": "Line",
          "position": "before",
          "sameLine": false,
          "value": " The resulting type an array literal expression is determined as follows:"
        },
        {
          "type": "Line",
          "position": "before",
          "sameLine": false,
          "value": "     - If the array literal contains no spread elements and is contextually typed by a tuple-like type,"
        },
        {
          "type": "Line",
          "position": "before",
          "sameLine": false,
          "value": "       the resulting type is a tuple type constructed from the types of the element expressions."
        }
